{
  "id": "b2.11-reporting-verbs",
  "district": "B2",
  "order": 11,
  "title": "Глаголы пересказа: suggest, admit, deny, warn",
  "theory": [
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "md": "Вместо said пересказ точнее передают глаголы со своей конструкцией. **suggest + -ing** или **suggest that**: He suggested **waiting**. **admit / deny + -ing**: She denied **taking** it. **warn + кого + (not) to**: He warned us **not to go**. **promise / refuse / agree + to**: Rory refused **to answer**."
    },
    {
      "kind": "table",
      "head": [
        "Глагол",
        "Конструкция",
        "Пример"
      ],
      "rows": [
        {
          "cells": [
            "suggest",
            "+ -ing",
            "He suggested taking the short path."
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            "admit / deny",
            "+ -ing",
            "She admitted lying."
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            "warn",
            "+ кого + (not) to",
            "The keeper warned us not to leave the path."
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            "refuse / promise",
            "+ to",
            "He refused to help."
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            "accuse",
            "+ кого + of + -ing",
            "They accused him of stealing."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "tip",
      "md": "«He suggested me to go» — ошибка. Нужно He suggested **going** или He suggested **that I go**."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "es": "Sam suggested camping by the stream.",
      "ru": "Сэм предложил встать лагерем у ручья."
    },
    {
      "es": "Rory admitted stealing the fragments.",
